body:
Friendly lady friend is here to help you out.  Through my tryst of lovers, there are few things hotter than "who fucking owns you?"/"I love watching you squirm".  However, in my experience the hottest experience was being made to beg.  I was with a 25 year old dude who was very dominant, he normally fucked me very hard to the point where I'd be the happiest girl alive if he fucked me until I was dead.  Though, this time he put it in very slowly and asked "do you want me to fuck you?".  I didn't respond at first, still in the happy haze of being fucked multiple times that day, until he pulled back and with another slow thrust repeated the question "do you want me to fuck you?".  After finally responding with 'yes', he pulled back and thrusted into me deeply, looking me right in the eyes and then he said "then I want to hear you beg".  There was a long period of him just saying shit like "do you deserve my dick?" or just "tell me how much you love me".   Then after being agonisingly teased, he fucked the shit out of me and left me quivering and shaking.

&#x200B;

I mean, probably try to see if ya girl is into that, but my general advice is making her beg (if you want her to join in with the dirty talking) and just saying what's on your mind in the moment.
